只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Notched reasoning-effort slider grouped with the model picker for DeepSeek Harness — native styling, themeable, i18n","id":"gh:1363263774","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"plugin-effort-slider","slug":"mrSutivu/plugin-effort-slider","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","i18n","model-picker","reasoning","slider"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Notched reasoning-effort slider grouped with the model picker for DeepSeek Harness — native styling,"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"g-effort slider grouped with the model picker for DeepSeek Harness — native styling, themeable, i18n"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Effort Slider for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**English** | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A reasoning-effort slider for DeepSeek Harness (DSH) that lives in the composer. Codex and Claude Co"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"de have one. DSH didn't, so I built it. One pill holds the model picker and the slider, right where "},{"id":"p4s3","text":"ne. DSH didn't, so I built it. One pill holds the model picker and the slider, right where you type."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"| Dark | Light |"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- **One pill for model and effort.** Picker and slider share one bordered pill with a separator betw"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"een them. The slider sits right of the model name.\n- **The model list skips the submenu.** One click"},{"id":"p7s3","text":" shows every provider and model. Effort stays on the slider and nowhere else.\n- **Notches instead of"},{"id":"p7s4","text":" a smooth drag.** Each notch is a real effort level from the model, usually two to seven. Drag it, o"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"r focus it and use the arrows, Home, End. Screen readers get a real slider role.\n- **A little show a"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"t the top notch.** Max effort turns the bar into a moving gradient, a nod to DSH's own \"Deep diving."},{"id":"p7s7","text":"..\" shimmer. It stays still when you prefer reduced motion.\n- **It follows your theme.** Every color"},{"id":"p7s8","text":" comes from DSH variables, with one accent shared with the send button. Light, dark, future theme pl"},{"id":"p7s9","text":"ugins, it all carries over.\n- **It speaks your language.** Labels follow the DSH locale in English, "},{"id":"p7s10","text":"French and Chinese. Model and effort names stay exactly as the model sends them.\n- **The context rin"},{"id":"p7s11","text":"g gets out of the way.** While the pill is up, the ring moves to the end of the stats row instead of"},{"id":"p7s12","text":" crowding the send button.\n- **A taller prompt box.** About two lines, same as the DSH hero input.\n-"},{"id":"p7s13","text":" **Nothing lives in core.** The plugin is one folder. Delete it and DSH forgets it was there."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"DSH with the `web` profile, and a model that exposes reasoning efforts. No effort levels, no slider."},{"id":"p9s2","text":" Anything with `low / medium / high` works."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Compatibility and permissions"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Needs the `web` profile (composer slots, model directory, locale). Pure client UI. No host permissio"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"ns, no credentials, no network calls, no external services. Runs wherever the `web` profile runs. Te"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"sted on DSH `0.1.2-alpha`. Limitation: the pill only shows for models exposing reasoning efforts."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"From GitHub, no npm account needed:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Or clone it first:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Then restart the `web` profile once with `dsh web` and refresh the page. Later client-only edits app"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"ly on a plain refresh."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"From npm:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"1. Pick a reasoning model in the pill.\n2. Drag the slider and let go. It applies on release.\n3. Push"},{"id":"p21s2","text":" it to the top notch for the gradient."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"If the model has no reasoning levels, the pill hides and the stock DSH selector is back."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Theming"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Everything runs off one accent, `var(--dsw-alias-button-info-fill)`, the send button fill. A theme p"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"lugin that redefines it recolors the slider, the notches, the max gradient and the checkmark. Nothin"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"ines it recolors the slider, the notches, the max gradient and the checkmark. Nothing else to touch."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## i18n"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Strings live under the `effort-slider` locale namespace in English, French and Chinese. To add your "},{"id":"p26s2","text":"language, register dictionaries for that namespace and open a PR. `locale.addLanguage` covers you if"},{"id":"p26s3","text":" the language pack itself is missing."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Uninstall"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Restart `dsh web` once. The pill, the styles, the meter move and the prompt height all revert."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Dev"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"No build. Edit `lib/client.js` and refresh. `lib/index.js` is an empty host entry. The bundle layer "},{"id":"p31s2","text":"wants one, so it gets one."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Contributing"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Issues and PRs welcome. New locale dictionaries make the easiest first contribution. Theme edge case"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"s and provider quirks matter most, since effort counts differ per model."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Support"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"Free forever, MIT. If the slider saves you clicks every day, a coffee keeps it maintained:"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"GitHub Sponsors works too, once onboarding clears: github.com/sponsors/mrSutivu."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"MIT © Sutivu"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
